   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSNC EAST 2009 - SSNC EAST EUROPE 2009</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A three year Framework Agreement for 2009-2011, with main focus of on strengthening of civil society in the area of environment and climate issues. The Programme is divided in several sub-programmes such as climate, water, forestry etc. This a program aimed at Eastern European countries and amounts to 8,9 MSEK for three years. The rest of the agreement can be found under 54030001</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tre &#xE5;rigt ramavtal med Naturskyddsf&#xF6;reningen under perioden  2009-2011, som syftar till att st&#xE4;rka civila samh&#xE4;llen inom milj&#xF6; och klimat omr&#xE5;det. Programmet &#xE4;r &#xE4;ven indelat i flera olika delprogram som finns under komponent: 54030001</narrative>
  </description>
